{"unit_id":"EdwardXiao-bit__dsh-run-button#card-zh","repo":"EdwardXiao-bit/dsh-run-button","commit":"bae7ac02138420dc1cbbd96963122922794131ec","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-run-button 是 DSH Web 插件，会在回复中的 Shell 命令代码块旁加入运行按钮，并在输入框上方提供运行列表。它通过宿主 shell 服务启动命令，经 Connection RPC 轮询输出和状态；支持停止运行、复制输出和选择工作目录。输出可显示在右下角浮动卡片，也可在安装 dsh-better-sidebar 时显示为每次运行一个底部面板标签，还可以关闭输出。它识别 bash、sh、zsh、console、PowerShell 和 cmd 等命令行代码块，并保留近期运行以便回看。适合希望直接从回复运行命令并查看结果的用户，无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:750-765","lib/client.js:791-820","lib/client.js:836-875","lib/index.js:217-279","lib/client.js:729-743","lib/client.js:1132-1151"]}
{"unit_id":"EdwardXiao-bit__dsh-run-button#card-en","repo":"EdwardXiao-bit/dsh-run-button","commit":"bae7ac02138420dc1cbbd96963122922794131ec","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-run-button adds Run buttons to shell blocks in DSH web replies. It runs commands through the host shell and shows output in floating cards or dsh-better-sidebar tabs. Users can stop runs, copy results, and choose a working directory. Bash, PowerShell, and cmd work. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:750-765","lib/client.js:791-820","lib/client.js:836-875","lib/index.js:217-279","lib/client.js:729-743","lib/client.js:1132-1151"]}
